1
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,380
Hello.

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,220
I’m Emi.

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,300
I’m Bonnie.

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,160
We are at Suvarnabhumi Airport.

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:15,780
We are going to Taipei.

6
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:20,680
We are holding a fan meeting in Taipei.

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:24,680
Yes, this is my first time in Taipei.

8
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,640
I’m so excited to meet our fans there.

9
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:32,960
Yes, I’m looking forward to seeing our fans.

10
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:36,120
We also prepared special performances for the show.

11
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,080
(Did you prepare 100 performances for the show?)

12
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,740
Yes, we prepared 100 outfits for the show.

13
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,000
(Really?)

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,900
We’re going to rip our outfits off on the stage.

15
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,640
It’s 100-layer outfits.

16
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,900
We will change masks, too.

17
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:50,120
We’ll go all out.

18
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,780
See you.

19
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,700
I’m signing posters.

20
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,400
I should run a test first.

21
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,620
Where should I do it?

22
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:00,660
Do you have any paper?

23
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:03,020
I’ll run a test.

24
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,320
Perfect.

25
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:08,600
My hand is shaking.

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,060
Okay.

27
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:17,120
This is the first signed poster for my first fan meeting.

28
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:19,680
I’ll sign below my face.

29
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,100
It looks cute.

30
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,300
(How was dinner?)

31
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:28,500
I’m so full.

32
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:31,080
This is the biggest meal I’ve had in a few months.

33
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,740
It was delicious, the sweet and sour pork.

34
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,920
What is it called?

35
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:41,160
Sweet pork and candied tomatoes.

36
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:44,680
Sweet pork and candied tomatoes.
I thought it was candied jujubes.

37
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,500
(Me too.)

38
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,360
I ate three bowls of it.

39
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:49,980
(By yourself?)

40
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:50,700
Yes.

41
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,400
I ate three bowls.

42
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,240
It’s so delicious.

43
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:56,780
The Mala noodles are also delicious.

44
00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:59,140
I recommend it.

45
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:04,500
I also had bubble milk tea with regular and small boba.

46
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,660
We are in Taipei. I want to try it.

47
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:19,780
These are E-M-I. It looks like two hearts.

48
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,920
It also looks like a butterfly.

49
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,200
How did I come up with it?

50
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,080
Are you filming us?

51
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:31,380
Cut and start right here.

52
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,180
What are you doing?

53
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:35,060
I’ve waited for you for some time.

54
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:36,080
Where have you been?

55
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,960
I went to a toilet.

56
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:46,260
(What is the sign in front of your autograph?
A bunny?)

57
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:49,060
It’s supposed to be the peace sign.

58
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:50,020
But many people think it’s a bunny.

59
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:52,060
It’s okay if you see it either way.

60
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:54,280
It can be seen as a bunny.

61
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,120
Yes, bunny – Bonnie.

62
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,980
It can be seen as bunny ears.

63
00:02:57,980 --> 00:03:00,520
Many people told me I looked like a bunny.

64
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,060
Who?

65
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:04,580
Some people. Now, they say I look like a puppy.

66
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:08,780
Mala dumplings are so delicious.

67
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,900
Bubble tea is also good.

68
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:13,140
Which dish do you want to recommend?

69
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,580
Mala dumplings.

70
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:15,500
That’s all?

71
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:18,500
And the noodles served with dumplings.

72
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:21,220
The dry noodles, right?

73
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,080
No, it’s Mala noodles.

74
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,300
I’m not sure if it’s egg noodles.

75
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:26,480
I’m not sure if it’s egg noodles.
Is it dry noodles?

76
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,940
After you sign it, you should pass it to me.

77
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:30,520
The ink is not dry yet.

78
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,680
I’ve used this autograph since I was in high school.

79
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,380
You’ve been practicing to be a celebrity
since you were in high school?

80
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:39,220
No, I was selling my paintings
when I was in high school.

81
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:43,520
Artists need to have a signature.

82
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:45,660
Did you make any money from it?

83
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:46,440
Yes.

84
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:47,560
Did you make a lot of money?

85
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,760
I got several thousand baht.

86
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,380
Really?

87
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:49,800
Yes.

88
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:55,460
Let’s go get some rest.

89
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:46,980
Wow!

90
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:49,720
Wow!

91
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,140
Wow!

92
00:04:58,580 --> 00:04:59,880
Hello, everyone.

93
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:02,560
We are backstage.

94
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:06,120
We are about to step on the stage.

95
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,520
I’m so nervous.

96
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,340
I’m so nervous.

97
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,920
(How was the rehearsal?)

98
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,540
I was doing well at the rehearsal.

99
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:17,760
But on the real stage, I’m not sure how well I will do.

100
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:18,940
You need to wait and see.

101
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,700
I forgot to sing.

102
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:24,540
Bonnie tried to give me a sign
but I didn’t understand it.

103
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,760
But the show must go on.

104
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,300
The show must go on.

105
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:33,640
But I could feel a dark aura pointing at me.

106
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,720
Let’s check out our show.

107
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:38,320
I’ll secretly pinch her.

108
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,540
If she doesn’t feel it, her skin is probably numb.

109
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:20,180
Hello, Taipei.

110
00:06:20,180 --> 00:06:21,480
Hello.

111
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,880
Hello.

112
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,020
Hello.

113
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:30,700
Hello, everyone. I’m Emi.

114
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:36,700
Hello, everyone. I’m Bonnie.

115
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:42,260
Have you ever visited Taipei?

116
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:44,180
I’m not sure.
I might visit here when I was young.

117
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,700
I don’t remember it.

118
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,920
I’ve never been here.

119
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,920
I think I’ve never been here either.

120
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:51,560
When I asked people for food recommendations.

121
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,660
Their answer is…

122
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,220
Bubble tea.

123
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:54,880
Yes.

124
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,920
She wakes up.

125
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:01,580
It’s xiao long bao.

126
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:11,740
Bowling.

127
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,240
Correct.

128
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:31,360
Good luck.

129
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:23,260
It’s a wrap for our 1st fan meeting in Taipei.

130
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:24,440
Right.

131
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:28,180
I’m so happy to meet our fans here.

132
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:32,220
We received a warm welcome.
Everyone is very nice.

133
00:10:32,220 --> 00:10:34,840
They are so sweet. They sang along with us.

134
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,440
Yes, they can sing the whole song.

135
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:39,400
I was so proud and happy.

136
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,480
Many fans came to meet us today.
It’s more than I expected.

137
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,960
I’m so happy.

138
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,760
I want to come back and meet everyone again.

139
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:47,360
I hope we will have a chance to meet again.

140
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,000
Yes.

141
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:53,720
Thank you to everyone who attended our show today.

142
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:58,000
I’m very happy to be here and meet everyone.

143
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:02,380
Thank you for supporting our series and us.

144
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:07,140
I hope we will have a new series soon.

145
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:09,180
Please continue to support us.

146
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:10,200
Please support us.
Thank you.

147
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:13,600
Thank you.

148
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,420
Where will be the next stop for our fan meeting?

149
00:11:15,420 --> 00:11:18,240
Please stay tuned.

150
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:22,060
Bye.

